# Loading-State Validation

Lazy panels show a Suspense fallback while their chunk loads. Local chunks load fast — to actually see a fallback, add a temp 2s delay to its `lazy()` import: `new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000)).then(() => import(...))`. Or CPU-throttle 6× in DevTools (network throttle won't work — chunks are local `file://`).

Tick the **Done** box once a row passes.

